      "writtenOn": "2017-11-15T16:41:17Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "It would be better if the default is none, i.e. if a key is not provided then we either reject the request or proceed with no auth.   You can put a post on the voltha-discuss channel and ask which option is better - allow insecure or reject the request.  Having hardcoded values in the code, even if it\u0027s default, would be an issue when the location of the key/certs changes or even the method of acquiring the key/cert changes.",
      "parentUuid": "9a5c5d37_55d10656",
      "revId": "c9b39b05aa317f5096823bb41d05ad1158fe5e9c",
